WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.460
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.920
I couldn't stop him from 
activating his Skill!

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.060
Storm Access!

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:27.710
Playmaker?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.680
Thank you.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.150
But that had nothing to do with this duel.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.420
Yeah, you're right.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.090
I tribute Scan Doll to activate its effect!

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:45.260
Excode Talker is allowed to attack twice!

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.960
Excode Talker attacks you directly!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.040
Then I attack you directly!

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.740
Excode Close!

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:20.600
You now have the backdoor to 
SOL Technologies' data bank.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.250
Until next time.

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.710
I run Across the universe

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.880
At the speed of light

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.750
Begin Loading

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:51.480
Open the door of dreams

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.050
VRAINS spreads

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.160
Believe in myself

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.690
VRAINS continues

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:07.000
The circuit draws the future

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:11.070
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:12.670
Access!

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.370
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.980
I'm now With the Wind

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.280
Link with my soul

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.050
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:23.780
Now Win the Race

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.620
Connected world

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:30.120
No matter when

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:33.490
Nothing is impossible

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.630
Strive for hope

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:42.200
And ride the wind!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:06.440
It's the schematics for SOL 
Technologies' mother computer.

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:09.200
Yeah.  And this is...

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.810
The backdoor route to the data bank.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.340
Ghost Girl had this?

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.860
Even among top hackers, there 
aren't many who's this good.

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:29.220
She's incredible.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.060
She's special.  Who is she?

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.450
I'll be ready before school ends.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.410
Stop by later.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.070
We'll infiltrate the mother computer tonight.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.680
Okay.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:29.930
Zaizen?  She hasn't come to 
school, much less the club.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:32.390
It's been awhile.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.850
I see.  She hasn't shown up.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:37.760
I knew she was an introvert.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.870
But now she doesn't even come to school.

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.960
Anyway, in LINK VRAINS-

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:55.210
Since that day, Blue Angel 
hasn't shown up in LINK VRAINS.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:58.480
Maybe her brother is blocking access.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.590
Telling her to stop being a duelist.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:05.180
But after what happened, can you blame him?

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:14.130
Are you worried about that cutie?

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:18.360
As a duelist, it shouldn't end like this.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.470
Maybe she'll show up when the heat dies down.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:31.650
Not permitted to leave!

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:34.130
As ordered by your brother.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.940
You hacked into my company's 
mother computer...

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.860
...and gave the data to Playmaker?

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:08.310
What are you thinking?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:11.750
Don't you want to know what 
happened ten years ago?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.380
And how your company was involved?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.660
But that's top secret of top secrets.

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:23.190
Due to your demotion, you don't 
have authority to find out.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.930
Even though you work in 
the data room all day.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:33.380
But what if Playmaker infiltrates 
the mother computer?

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:37.080
Kitamura, your successor 
as Security Manager...

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.880
...will be eager to eliminate Playmaker.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.260
Because he'll be held responsible.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:48.740
So if we use that opportunity to infiltrate 
the mother computer, no one will notice.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.620
So to use Playmaker as a decoy...

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:56.090
...you lost on purpose and 
gave him the secret data?

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.560
I didn't lose on purpose.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:01.920
Well, fine.  I understand.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:10.880
If my company is covering up its involvement 
ten years ago, I can't ignore it.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.050
Let's hope all goes well.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.050
Anyway...

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:20.220
I know you're there, Blue Angel.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.460
She knew!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:28.110
Want a chance to restore your reputation?

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:36.640
Prototype A and B have switched to Duel Mode.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.290
The duel will begin.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.270
Begin the duel!

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.740
Speed Duel!

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:44.740
Activation status, both normal.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.520
Increase thinking speed by 20%.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.220
Roger.  Thinking speed, up 20%.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.940
I've created AI duelists using 
100% artificial intelligence.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.960
They're near completion.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:08:00.850
I Special Summon Tentacluster Darkwhip.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:06.200
Prototype A, processing speed 7% up.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:22.550
They're excellent tools.  Wonderful.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:26.060
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Abyss Invitation.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:30.300
Prototype B, reflex speed 5% up.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:34.290
Yes, AIs are nothing more 
than tools for humans.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:38.880
People use AIs, not the other way around.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:43.300
Zaizen, that's what you don't understand.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:46.300
Your era is over.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:57.320
There must be a lead to the incident ten 
years ago at the center in the data bank.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.710
Incident ten years ago...

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.050
Yeah, I hope there is.

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:07.480
There are many security traps 
blocking your way to the center.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.720
I've already created ways to deal with them.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.970
You work fast.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.030
Leave it to me.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:18.000
We're linked to SOL's mother computer.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:22.710
Hey, aren't you going?

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:26.140
#1: This data may not be credible.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:31.180
#2: Why did Ghost Girl give us this data?

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:34.660
Why?  Because you won the duel.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.650
Even if that's true...

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:42.630
#3: Ghost Girl won't do something 
unless it benefits her.

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:45.630
Why are you saying this now?

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:48.630
I said it might be a trap from the start!

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:49.870
Lost your nerve?

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.340
I didn't say I wasn't going.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:56.070
He's just saying that it 
never hurts to be careful.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.460
What's with that!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.760
Humans are so annoying!

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:07.250
Deck set!  Into the VRAINS!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.160
Take this, Yusaku!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.080
Move vertically down from Point 434.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.310
Roger.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.420
Maintain speed and continue diving.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.510
Roger.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:29.930
Unlike LINK VRAINS, this place is desolate.

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.970
And this tail...  So uncool.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:38.980
As long as it's connected, it emits jamming 
waves so that you won't be detected.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.840
I know, but...

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.680
At Depth 5160, switch to horizontal.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.120
Good.  Keep going straight.

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.370
We don't know what's up ahead.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.400
It's testing our courage.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.370
Turn right at the end.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.940
Turn on the third left corner.

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:17.280
What?  Something's coming!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:20.020
Be careful!  If you hit it, you'll be erased!

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.770
It's a security trap!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.490
Another one is coming!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.220
I set Sphere Kuriboh.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.960
Use it as a decoy!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:35.660
Take the side road and 
turn right immediately!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.480
You only have one Sphere Kuriboh left!

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.180
Good.  Keep going straight.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.250
You're almost through Area A.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:36.540
That was easy!  Let's get to the goal!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.100
What?  A Data Storm?

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.480
There's a Data Storm here?

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.140
We have to go through?

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.660
It's too dangerous!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.380
We have to give up-

00:13:54.980 --> 00:14:00.250
No.  If we dive deeper, the 
Data Storm's effect will be...

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.960
The tail!

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.290
Flee!

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.350
W-What's going on?

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:29.950
Intruder in the mother computer!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.160
What?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.420
I'll put it on screen!

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:36.760
P-Playmaker!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:38.990
They know we're here!

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.730
Now what will you do, Playmaker?

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.730
Why is he here?

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:56.750
Redirect Prototype A and B immediately!

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.950
Exterminate Playmaker!

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:03.850
Duelists?

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.630
Found Playmaker.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.460
They're 100% AI duelists!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.160
SOL Technologies can make these?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.430
Beginning Speed Duel.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:21.170
Hey!  Didn't they teach 
you that duels are 1-on-1?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.680
It's going as planned.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.170
Kitamura sent his precious AI squad.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.400
He's desperate.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.520
C'mon.  Let's go.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:32.350
Yeah.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.720
Into the VRAINS!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:40.320
Sheesh!  No one taught them manners!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.590
We can't duel them normally.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.200
What will you do, Playmaker?

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:59.910
Hey, Playmaker!

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.790
Don't turn this into a bigger deal!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.610
Give me a break!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.810
Split into two groups.  Formation D!

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.550
Hurry!  As fast as possible!

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:13.550
Before the higher-ups learn about this!

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:17.960
If they find out, I'm finished!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:26.820
But if I win this duel...

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:31.920
They'll support AI duelists, 
and I'll acquire the Ignis!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:35.130
And my reputation will rise!

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.740
This is a unique opportunity!

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:44.230
Okay, Playmaker!  Just you wait!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.150
I was waiting for this!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.860
We didn't run away.  We'll prove it.

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:55.660
A duel is 1-on-1.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.560
Switching to Duel Mode.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:02.300
Prototype A will begin dueling Playmaker.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:06.180
You must win!  Losing is not allowed!

00:17:06.180 --> 00:17:09.770
My promotion depends on it!

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.610
Speed Duel!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.600
My turn.

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:21.260
I pay 500 LP to Special Summon 
Tentacluster Darkwhip from my hand.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:29.340
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Machine Duplication.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:32.620
I Special Summon two Darkwhips from my deck.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:36.840
It's ready!

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.440
Begin Link Summon!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:43.670
Circuit open!

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:49.000
Summoning conditions are three Tentaclusters.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.910
I set three Darkwhips.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.630
Link Summon.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:02.840
Link 3 Tentacluster Nautilus!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.800
Link Summon successful!

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:09.040
Operation efficiency 99.98%!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:12.070
Summoning speed 0.8% higher than before!

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:15.310
Tentacluster Nautilus's effect activates.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.680
By Link Summoning this monster...

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:23.460
...I Special Summon Tentacluster Drillworm 
from my hand next to its link.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:30.360
I summon another Tentacluster 
Drillworm from my hand.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:36.760
Good.  Show him that AI 
duelists have great specs!

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.760
Due to Tentacluster Nautilus's effect...

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:44.360
...once per turn, it can destroy 
monsters that it's linked to.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:50.270
Tentacluster Drillworm's 
effect now activates.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:55.020
I select one random card in your 
hand and send it to the graveyard.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:01.620
If this effect sends a monster 
card to the graveyard...

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:05.090
...another card in your 
hand goes to the graveyard.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.660
It's a hand destruction deck.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.300
That deck has no flavor.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.060
Actually, it's a viable strategy.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:16.270
So deadpan.  Are you an AI?

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:22.010
Due to the other Drillworm's effect, I send 
another card in your hand to the graveyard.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:28.250
If it's a monster card, another 
card is sent to the graveyard.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.420
I end my turn.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:35.630
You have no luck whatsoever.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:41.630
If it chose Cynet Defrag first, 
you could've kept Linkslayer.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:44.630
I bet you're horrible at old maid.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:45.360
Be quiet!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.830
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:03.650
Why is Playmaker having so much trouble?

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:10.850
I banish Drillworm from my 
graveyard to activate its effect.

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:17.600
I select one random card in your 
hand and send it to the graveyard.

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:23.850
And I Special Summon a Drillworm from 
my graveyard in defense position.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.670
Just when you drew a card, 
it was sent to the graveyard!

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:32.030
It's so thorough.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:41.950
Playtime is over, Playmaker.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.600
Hey!  That's not fair!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:57.840
Did you forget that you're 
inside our mother computer?

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:01.500
I won't let you do whatever you 
like inside SOL Technologies!

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.040
This isn't LINK VRAINS.

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:08.440
I'll do anything to accomplish my goal.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.720
You'll regret coming here.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:16.220
Aim for Playmaker's Duel Disk!  Steal it!

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:19.940
Hurry up and give the orders!

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.960
Or I'll fire you!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.100
Just do as I say!

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.540
Roger.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.140
They're going crazy!

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:42.250
Hey, AIs?  Stop doing whatever you want.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.060
Blue Angel!

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:48.190
I'm the one who'll defeat Playmaker!

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:50.650
So leave!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.140
You're interfering with us?

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.860
If so, we will eliminate you.

00:21:55.860 --> 00:21:58.640
Oh.  Then I guess I have no choice.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.020
I'll take you on!

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:27.140
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:30.650
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:34.280
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:34.570 --> 00:22:38.320
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:42.210
Try It over and over

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:50.370
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:57.310
The timeline flows forever

00:22:57.600 --> 00:22:59.870
Nothing is certain

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.550
In these isolated times

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:03.310
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

00:23:03.540 --> 00:23:05.080
Cuz We Still Believin' Magic

00:23:05.300 --> 00:23:08.470
The traces we leave behind

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:12.040
The traces we leave behind

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:16.010
The miracles we create

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:18.250
Never Give Up Never!

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:22.100
I won't give up  Never Give Up Never!

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:41.020
Nothing people do is perfect.

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:45.480
People have infinite potential 
because they're imperfect.

00:23:45.700 --> 00:23:49.580
The AI's duel has been 
optimized for perfection.

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:53.740
But Playmaker's duel relies on randomness.

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:55.810
How will this match end?

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:58.420
Duels are more than calculations.

00:23:58.420 --> 00:24:02.980
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Flawless AI Duelist

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:05.280
Into the VRAINS!
